    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3790890/extras/a7f03ca37d01a2927da744845e8e99a9.poster.avif?t=1754944065\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3790890/extras/a7f03ca37d01a2927da744845e8e99a9.webm?t=1754944065\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3790890/extras/a7f03ca37d01a2927da744845e8e99a9.mp4?t=1754944065\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will your village survive or thrive? Rebuild your shattered home in this text-driven RPG. Gather scarce resources, hone your skills, and explore the troubled land of Demagost. Pick your battles \u2014 fight, negotiate, or flee. Your choices shape not just your story, but the fate of the kingdom itself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3790890/extras/6a1df98604a1ed1b08d25f813df62f86.poster.avif?t=1754944065\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3790890/extras/6a1df98604a1ed1b08d25f813df62f86.webm?t=1754944065\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3790890/extras/6a1df98604a1ed1b08d25f813df62f86.mp4?t=1754944065\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3790890/extras/a7f03ca37d01a2927da744845e8e99a9.poster.avif?t=1754944065\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3790890/extras/a7f03ca37d01a2927da744845e8e99a9.webm?t=1754944065\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3790890/extras/a7f03ca37d01a2927da744845e8e99a9.mp4?t=1754944065\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will your village survive or thrive? Rebuild your shattered home in this text-driven RPG. Gather scarce resources, hone your skills, and explore the troubled land of Demagost. Pick your battles \u2014 fight, negotiate, or flee. Your choices shape not just your story, but the fate of the kingdom itself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3790890/extras/6a1df98604a1ed1b08d25f813df62f86.poster.avif?t=1754944065\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3790890/extras/6a1df98604a1ed1b08d25f813df62f86.webm?t=1754944065\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3790890/extras/6a1df98604a1ed1b08d25f813df62f86.mp4?t=1754944065\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
